### **7. UserAccountServiceImpl.java**
**Location:** `core/service/src/main/java/com/property/rental/service/core/service/`

**What was changed:**

**Registration:**
```java
public Map<String, Object> registerUser(UserAccountEntity user) {
    // Encrypt password
    user.setPassword(passwordEncoder.encode(user.getPassword()));
    
    // Assign default role
    if (user.getRoles() == null || user.getRoles().isEmpty()) {
        user.setRoles(Collections.singletonList(Role.ROLE_USER.name()));
    }
    
    userAccountDao.save(user);
    return Map.of("message", "User registered successfully");
}
```

**Login:**
```java
public ResponseEntity<?> login(LoginRequest request) {
    Optional<UserAccountEntity> user = userAccountDao.findByEmail(request.getEmail());
    
    // Verify password using BCrypt
    if (user.isPresent() && passwordEncoder.matches(request.getPassword(), user.get().getPassword())) {
        String token = jwtUtil.generateToken(user.get().getEmail());
        String userId = user.get().getId();
        return ResponseEntity.ok(new LoginResponse(token, userId));
    } else {
        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.UNAUTHORIZED).body("Invalid credentials");
    }
}
```

---

### **8. JwtUtil.java**
**Location:** `common/common-utility/src/main/java/com/property/rental/service/common/commonutils/`

**What was changed:**
- Reads secret key from `application.properties`
- Reads expiration time from properties
- Centralized signing key generation

**Key Methods:**
```java
// Generate token
public String generateToken(String email) {
    return Jwts.builder()
        .setSubject(email)
        .setIssuedAt(new Date())
        .setExpiration(new Date(System.currentTimeMillis() + EXPIRATION_TIME))
        .signWith(getSigningKey())
        .compact();
}

// Validate token
public boolean validateToken(String token, String username) {
    String extractedUsername = extractUsername(token);
    return extractedUsername.equals(username) && !isTokenExpired(token);
}
```

